*           created it, read back from the description CREATE_USER stamps.
*           The CREATUSR gate is gone, and the ACCOUNTS record is deleted last
*           so a failure leaves something the verb can be re-run against.
* rev 0.9.0 delete-account requires admin priv, are we admin?
*           on user account, delete os user if configured
* rev 1.0-1 use userdel not deluser (deluser not on all Linux version)
